  "result": "Excellent! The enhanced renderInvoiceText is complete and polished. Here's what was added:\n\n## Enhanced Features\n\n### 1. **Line Discounts** - Indented display\nShows when a line has tier/line/bulk discount:\n```\n10x Design work (hour) @ \u20ac85.00 = \u20ac850.00\n  Discount: \u20ac62.69\n```\n\n### 2. **Voucher** - Before Total\nDisplays fixed-amount discount when present:\n```\nVoucher: \u20ac50.00\nTotal: \u20ac1,247.50\n```\n\n### 3. **Due Date** - After Total\nShows payment deadline when invoice is issued:\n```\nDue: 2026-10-01\n```\n\n### 4. **Paid Amount** - Final line\nAggregates all payments received:\n```\nPaid: \u20ac300.00\n```\n\n## Output Order\nInvoice displays in logical flow:\n1. Invoice number/status\n2. Customer name\n3. Line items with unit prices and line totals\n4. Line discounts (indented, only if present)\n5. VAT (only if > 0)\n6. Voucher (only if present)\n7. Total\n8. Due date (only if present)\n9. Paid amount (only if payments exist)\n\n## Tests Added\n13 new test cases covering:\n- Individual features (discount, voucher, due, paid)\n- Indentation of discounts\n- Omission when not applicable\n- Aggregation of multiple payments\n- Bulk discount display\n- Correct ordering of all elements\n- Comprehensive \"all features\" scenario\n\nAll 320 tests pass!",
